{"title":"2020 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 1 Problem B","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>An equilateral triangle has sides of length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/8/788f77c1ec7957ee1f8b76bc377cca93bce87a6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/f/04f35b419d230c532cf67142c8a96890ad278753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y + 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/5/a859acebdd07c34704648be45c0daf108e2a29d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of \\$1 coins that Gray has. Since Gray also has an equal amount of \\$2 coins, this also is the number of \\$2 coins that she has.\n</p><p>The total amount of money is then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/f/78ff449ee295e8d0219adfa1e202a0e12d98fb31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$1 \\times c + \\$2 \\times c = \\$3 \\times c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"193\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>We know that, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/7/df703b6c4d8912d8738c2142ce37874da5a135e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t = 3c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/d/70d28cf73b4c627140844beb49f4deab8bfeede9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = \\frac{t}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"47\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_A\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 1 Problem A\">seat A</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/1/8e184083fd24cfe857b70038587e6a58226a444c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/6/e16d0751d6eeab692099236a9d588beae378966d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = \\frac{12}{3} = \\boxed{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"101\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC\">2020 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\